  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_64922.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; line-height: 21.33px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">Aquest diumenge s&#39;han acabat les festes d&#39;estiu de Suera, amb la desfilada i concurs de disfresses infantils, des de la Pla&ccedil;a fins a la Font Seca, amb la companyia de dol&ccedil;aines i tabals. Al final, la Comissi&oacute; de Festes ha obsequiat amb un detallet a xiquets i xiquetes.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; line-height: 21.33px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesinfantilsfestesagostsuera15/img_6479.jpg\" alt=\"img_6479\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesinfantilsfestesagostsuera15/img_6480.jpg\" alt=\"img_6480\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesinfantilsfestesagostsuera15/img_6481.jpg\" alt=\"img_6481\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"